
/**********************/
/* ACT II - AREA 3    */
/* COLD PUZZLE ROOM   */
/**********************/

/**********************/
:: Area 3

/* Player enters cold room */

\> You enter the cold room.

\> The air is freezing.

\> A gemstone is trapped inside layers of ice.

\> A lantern sits nearby.


\>> [[[Use the lantern.|area3_heat1]]]

/**********************/


/**********************/
:: area3_heat1

/* First heating stage */

\> You hold the lantern near the ice.

\> The outer layer starts to melt.


\>> [[[Keep heating.|area3_heat2]]]

/**********************/

/**********************/
:: area3_heat2

/* More melting */

\> More ice melts away.

\> You hear small crackling sounds.


\>> [[[Listen carefully.|area3_listen]]]
/**********************/

/**********************/
:: area3_listen

/* Crackling clue */

\> The crackling sound grows louder.

\> You wait and pay attention.

\> At the right moment, the last layer begins to break.


\>> [[[Free the gemstone.|area3_end]]]

\>> [[[Wait and listen again.|area3_listen]]]
/**********************/

/**********************/
:: area3_end

/* Gemstone freed */

\> The ice cracks open.

\> The gemstone is finally free.

\> You take it.


\>> [[[Go to Area 5.|area5_start]]]
/**********************/

